sequenceDiagram
    actor Guest
    actor Host
    participant Pricing
    participant Booking
    participant Availability
    participant Payments

    Guest->>Pricing: get a quote
    Pricing-->>Guest: QuoteId
    Guest->>Booking: request to book (QuoteId)
    Booking->>Availability: hold the nights
    Booking->>Payments: authorize the card
    Note over Booking: waits for the host (up to 24 h)
    Host->>Booking: accept
    Booking->>Availability: confirm the nights
    Booking-)Payments: capture the payment
